flowchart TD
    Start([User Initiates Authentication]) --> Choice{Action?}

    %% Registration Flow
    Choice -->|Register Member| RegInput[Input Details: Email, Name, Password, Branch, Plan]
    RegInput --> RegVal{Valid Input?}
    RegVal -->|No| RegErr[Show Validation Error: 400 Bad Request]
    RegErr --> RegInput
    RegVal -->|Yes| CheckEmail{Email Already Exists?}
    CheckEmail -->|Yes| Conflict[Return 409 Conflict: Email Registered]
    Conflict --> RegInput
    CheckEmail -->|No| HashPass[Hash Password with BCrypt cost=12]
    HashPass --> CreateUser[Create User & MemberProfile Entity in DB]
    CreateUser --> GenQR[Generate Unique QR Pass Hash Token]
    GenQR --> RegSuccess[Return 201 Created: Registration Complete]

    %% Login Flow
    Choice -->|Login| LoginInput[Input Credentials: Email & Password]
    LoginInput --> FetchUser{Find User by Email in DB?}
    FetchUser -->|Not Found| BadCreds[Return 401: Invalid Credentials]
    BadCreds --> LoginInput
    FetchUser -->|Found| CheckStatus{Is User & Gym Active?}
    CheckStatus -->|Suspended| InactiveErr[Return 403: Account/Gym Suspended]
    CheckStatus -->|Active| VerifyPass{BCrypt Password Match?}
    VerifyPass -->|No| BadCreds
    VerifyPass -->|Yes| IssueJWT[Issue Stateless JWT Access Token 15m & Refresh Token 7d]
    IssueJWT --> SaveRefresh[Store Encrypted Refresh Token in DB]
    SaveRefresh --> RetTokens[Return 200 OK: Access Token + User Info]
    RetTokens --> NavDash[Redirect User to Role-Specific Dashboard]
